  "details": "Literally that simple to stop a significant portion of armchair avatar rippers. \nThe majority of ripping software relies on the presence of the cache existing while the game is not currently running.\nBy forcing the cache to be emptied on launch/termination of the game, albeit possible to be avoided, will force rippers without the technical knowledge on how to avoid it to use their software while the game is active, allowing EAC to detect it and flag the account holder.\nThis is a simpler fix than cache encryption that will be less lag inducing for the end user. \nBoo hoo people may have to wait a little longer to load worlds but hey maybe give something back to the creators who support your game for once?",
